<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81525" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-κλάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twist round, bend</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
			φλόγα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				53
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀγκῶνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					10.6
				</span></i>
			 : but usu. <i>break off</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς
				δρῦς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				9.18
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κράνει π. τὸ ξίφος</span>
			<i>break</i> it <i>round</i> the helmet, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				14
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικεκλασμέναι ῥάβδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.6.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικλασθήσονται κλῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοσσὸς -κλασθεὶς ἀπὸ τῶν γονάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.25
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικλώμενα τοῖς αὑτῶν βρίθεσι</span>
			<i>bent and broken</i> by . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				12
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικεκλασμένον σχῆμα</span>
			<i>bent and bowed down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.878c
			</span></i> ; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς σώμασι -κλώμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					813a16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.48
			</span></i> ; but also, <i>arched</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώραξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).420
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικλώμενος κλύδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.9.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Optics,
				<i>refract</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				2.1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wheel</i> an army <i>round</i> to the right or left, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δόρυ</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀσπίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.12.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.23.2
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν Τίβεριν ἐπὶ τὸ
				Κίρκαιον</span>
			<i>divert</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of missiles, <i>ricochet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				79.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι περικεκλασμένοι</span>
			<i>rough, broken</i> ground, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.20.6
			</span></i> ; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφοι περικεκλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18.22.9
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίαι περικεκλ</span>. houses
				<i>on such ground</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.26A.
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικεκλασμένας λόφοις ἐρημίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					6.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
